<style>
:root{--bg:#0a1628;--panel:#0d1a30;--line:#dbe4ee;--text:#e8e4d8;--muted:#5d7186;--primary:#5fa8e8;--green:#1e7e4e}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font:16px/1.65 'DM Sans',system-ui,sans-serif}
.nav{padding:16px 24px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--panel)}
.nav a{color:var(--primary);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
.wrap{max-width:880px;margin:0 auto;padding:48px 24px}
.card{display:grid;grid-template-columns:300px 1fr;gap:36px;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:36px}
.card img{width:100%;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--line)}
h1{font-size:28px;line-height:1.25;margin-bottom:12px}
.price{font-size:30px;font-weight:700;margin:18px 0 4px}
.price span{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:400}
.desc{color:var(--muted)}
.buy{display:inline-block;margin-top:22px;padding:14px 30px;background:var(--primary);color:#0d1a30;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}
.meta{margin-top:18px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
.back{display:inline-block;margin-bottom:22px;color:var(--primary);text-decoration:none;font-size:14px}
@media(max-width:720px){.card{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="nav"><a href="/">ABUZ8 AI</a> · <a href="/store.html">Store</a></div>
<div class="wrap">
<a class="back" href="/store.html">&larr; Back to the store</a>
<div class="card">
  <div><img src="/assets/img/covers/sovereign_ai_stack.jpg" alt="Sovereign Coding Assistant — cinematic cover"></div>
  <div>
    <h1>Sovereign Coding Assistant</h1>
    <p class="desc">A local-first coding assistant you own — code review, generation, and docs without sending your code to the cloud.</p>
    <div class="price">$47 <span>one-time · instant download</span></div>
    <a class="buy" href="https://buy.stripe.com/3cI8wH4aN9ac3Qz9Qmebu0X" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Buy now — secure Stripe checkout &rarr;</a>
    <p class="meta">After payment, our fulfillment system emails you a download link (valid 48 hours) within minutes — link expired or missing? Email <a href="mailto:ahmad@abuz8ai.com" style="color:inherit">ahmad@abuz8ai.com</a> and we'll resend it, free. Tested before it's sold — if it's broken or not as described, <a href="/refund.html" style="color:inherit">we'll make it right</a>. Sold by ABUZ8 LLC.</p>
  </div>
</div>
</div>
</body></html>
